<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>API Documentation</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #121212; color: white; margin: 0; }
        .sidebar { position: fixed; width: 250px; height: 100%; background: #1e1e1e; padding: 1rem; }
        .sidebar h2 { text-align: center; color: #007bff; }
        .sidebar a { display: block; color: white; padding: 1rem; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; }
        .sidebar a:hover { background: #333; }
        .main-content { margin-left: 270px; padding: 2rem; }
        h1, h2 { color: #007bff; }
        .card { background: #1e1e1e; padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
        .api-key-section { background: #2c2c2c; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 4px; }
        .api-key-section code { background: #121212; padding: 0.5rem; border-radius: 4px; }
        .btn { padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem; border: none; border-radius: 4px; background-color: #007bff; color: white; font-size: 1rem; cursor: pointer; text-decoration: none; }
        pre { background: #2c2c2c; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 4px; white-space: pre-wrap; word-wrap: break-word; }
        code { font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; }
        .endpoint { background: #333; padding: 0.25rem 0.5rem; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: bold; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('partials/sidebar', { active: 'api-docs' }) %>
    <div class="main-content">
        <h1>API Documentation</h1>

        <div class="card">
            <h2>Your API Key</h2>
            <div class="api-key-section">
                <% if (apiKey) { %>
                    <p><strong>Your new API Key:</strong> Please save this key. It will not be shown again.</p>
                    <code><%= apiKey %></code>
                <% } else if (apiKeyExists) { %>
                    <p>You have already generated an API key. For security reasons, it cannot be displayed again. If you have lost it, you will need to contact support to have it revoked.</p>
                <% } else { %>
                    <p>You have not generated an API key yet.</p>
                    <form action="/api/v1/user/generate-apikey" method="POST">
                        <button type="submit" class="btn">Generate API Key</button>
                    </form>
                <% } %>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h2>Sending Messages</h2>
            <p>To send messages via the API, make a POST request to the following endpoint. You must include your API key in the <code>x-api-key</code> header.</p>
            <p><span class="endpoint">POST /api/v1/message/send</span></p>

            <h3>Headers</h3>
            <pre><code>Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: YOUR_API_KEY</code></pre>

            <h3>Send a Text Message</h3>
            <p>To send a simple text message, use the <code>text</code> message type.</p>
            <pre><code>{
    "deviceId": 1,
    "numbers": "6281234567890",
    "message": "Hello from the API!",
    "messageType": "text"
}</code></pre>

            <h3>Send a Media Message (Image/Document)</h3>
            <p>To send a media message, you must upload the file as <code>multipart/form-data</code>. The API does not support sending media from a URL via the JSON endpoint.</p>

            <p>The form data should contain the following fields:</p>
            <ul>
                <li><code>deviceId</code>: Your device ID.</li>
                <li><code>numbers</code>: The recipient's number.</li>
                <li><code>messageType</code>: Must be set to <code>media</code>.</li>
                <li><code>media</code>: The image or document file to upload.</li>
                <li><code>message</code>: (Optional) The caption for the media.</li>
            </ul>

            <p><strong>Example using cURL:</strong></p>
            <pre><code>curl -X POST \
  http://yourdomain.com/api/v1/message/send \
  -H 'x-api-key: YOUR_API_KEY' \
  -F 'deviceId=1' \
  -F 'numbers=6281234567890' \
  -F 'messageType=media' \
  -F 'message=Here is a test document!' \
  -F 'media=@/path/to/your/document.pdf'</code></pre>

            <h3>Sending to Multiple Numbers</h3>
            <p>For both text and media messages, you can send to multiple recipients by providing a comma-separated string of numbers.</p>
            <pre><code>{
    "deviceId": 1,
    "numbers": "6281234567890,6289876543210",
    "message": "This is a message to multiple people.",
    "messageType": "text"
}</code></pre>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
